message: "If you use this code, please cite the manuscript and the underlying data resources."
title: "Public-data two-sample Mendelian randomization of dairy production and conformation traits on female fertility in US Holstein cattle: analysis code and results"
authors:
  - family-names: Wu
    given-names: Changxian
  - family-names: Wang
    given-names: Min
  - family-names: Su
