repository-code: "https://github.com/ChangxianWu/public-data-MR-dairy-cattle-fertility"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-10-24"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Analysis code and published result tables for a cross-cohort two-sample
  Mendelian randomization study of dairy production/conformation traits on
  female fertility in US Holstein cattle, built exclusively from public
  summary statistics, with per-SNP allele-strand verification, Monte-Carlo
  calibration and power-based effect-size bounds.
keywords:
  - Mendelian randomization
  - dairy cattle
  - female fertility
  - allele harmonisation
  - reproducibility
